-home sleep apnea testing services; and breast pumps and related lactation equipment and supplies, including fulfillment and support services, as well as healthcare staffing and recruitment services. Viemed Healthcare, Inc. was founded in 2006 and is headquartered in Lafayette, Louisiana."}}